5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,We need a fair way to handle the bike spaces. I'll look into the complaint log and the association minutes.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is a delicate matter. I would like to see the morning departures and the rain exposure.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I'm curious about the money side. I'll check the building ledger and the ward cycle park.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,George,,I want to know the workload. I'll examine the treasurer's handover file and the supplier's display frame.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mio,,I want to see who is actually using the spots! I'll check the sticker register and the neighbouring block's account.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
