30,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"It seems the same people have held the best spots for years without any review. Also, many complaints about leaning bikes go nowhere.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"I saw that people are shifting other bikes to get out, and some spots get quite wet in the rain.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,May,,"The building account is nearly empty, but the ward park is expensive and has a long waiting list.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,George,,"New equipment requires maintenance, and billing would add a significant amount of paperwork to the treasurer's monthly tasks.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Daily riders are actually willing to pay for a spot, but the neighbors had issues with people skipping meetings over fees.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Mio, if people stop attending meetings, that's a real problem for the community.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@George, if the equipment is too hard to use, it might just cause more shoving.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,May,,"@George, is the paperwork really that bad? We need a way to fund improvements.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,George,,It's a burden that often falls on one person. We shouldn't create a job that will just lapse.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, but isn't it unfair that some people have had the same spots for five years?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"It is, but we must be careful not to create new animosities.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Shizue,,Perhaps a system where everyone takes a turn would be kinder.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,May,,Or we charge for them. It solves the fairness issue and the money issue.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,George,,I still worry about the administration of a payment system.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Mio,,I agree with May. The daily riders want to pay to ensure they have a spot.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,4,talk,Misaki,,I'm worried about the social cost of payments.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,4,talk,Shizue,,Let's see what the options are before we decide.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,4,talk,May,,I'm sure we can find a balance.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,4,talk,George,,As long as it's sustainable.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,4,talk,Mio,,I'm excited to see the choices!,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
